    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "This podcast explores belonging at Stanford and all the different communities one can belong to and the experiences of members in these communities. The podcast follows the story of a freshmen and the new communities he and his friends find themselves in sophomore year. The podcast focuses on what belonging at Stanford means, how you can find it, and what it's like when you do. Sophomore slump and it's reasons are also addressed by the narrator. This podcast is meant to be helpful for anyone at Stanford who feels like they don't have a strong community and wants a starting point to find one.",
